<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat August subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to August totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    913,114  (670,009)  5,129,819  (4,143,312)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    147,453  (102,476)  1,438,118  (1,435,513)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	27,169   (52,574)    164,082    (173,739)</p>
<p> Linseed expls    19,951   (16,641)     97,044     (78,051)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    4,001    (6,101)     25,394     (24,496)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   15,826    (4,233)    129,608    (150,194)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     174,371  (152,501)  1,002,201    (861,760)</p>
<p> Sunoil	    111,304  (116,337)    952,101    (992,381)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in August were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 107,799; Iran 102,425; Spain 100,965; Holland 87,911</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 73,417; Denmark 30,135; Britain 24,800</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
